// PROBE 6 — the coverage gate as it really is: quantified over the requirement set.
// Tasks cover requirements as a declared traceability table (task.json.requirements).
// `TOTAL` scans it and NAMES any requirement with no covering task.
// Expect WARNING naming r3 (dropped requirement). Add `FACT r3 covered_by t3` -> clears.
// (Legacy plan = empty requirements set = no TOTAL emitted = vacuously passes.)
DOMAIN cover
SET requirements
    r1
    r2
    r3
FACT r1 covered_by t1
FACT r2 covered_by t2
// r3 has no covering task -> the coverage gap
TOTAL covered_by ON requirements
CHECK
